  "description": "ShadowDusk SkSL front-end: a pure-managed, zero-native converter that translates a Skia SkSL runtime-effect shader (half4 main(float2 coord)) into a self-contained HLSL .fx source (SkSLToFxConverter.Convert). With ShadowDusk.Compiler installed, ShaderConverter.Compile reads a .sksl shader directly. Standalone and optional, not part of the faithful mgfxc-replacement pipeline.",
